Algorithm acknowledgment
------------------------

The AVX2 decoder's subtract-one classification and delta tables are adapted
from Daniel Lemire's public-domain base16 example:
https://github.com/lemire/Code-used-on-Daniel-Lemire-s-blog/blob/23fa12e7a1f705d3e6fa9589b6d573b078c30618/2023/07/27/src/base16.c

The upstream repository's README at that commit places its code in the public
domain unless otherwise stated. The referenced component states no exception.
The Rust implementation, bounded slice handling, dispatch, and error reporting
in this crate are distributed under the MIT license above.
